    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You are an excellent shot with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bowcaster\" title=\"Bowcaster\">bowcaster</a>, and even your most difficult shots are solid hits.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiee\" title=\"Wookiee\">Wookiee</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to add to an attack with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bowcaster\" title=\"Bowcaster\">Bowcaster</a>, if you hit the target, you gain a competence bonus to your damage roll equal to the amount added to the attack.</p>",
